.Dd October 4, 2026
.Dt UNAME 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm uname
.Nd print system information
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl asvnrm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
print certain system information.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
print all the available information.
.It Fl s
print the kernel name, default.
.It Fl n
print the network node hostname.
.It Fl r
print the kernel release
.It Fl v
print the kernel version
.It Fl m
print the machine's architecture.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh AUTHORS
.An juanvel400
